abstract: >
  PysternBlot is a GPLv3 Python GUI application for building
  publication-ready Western blot panels with hierarchical
  lane annotations. It supports ECL and NIR fluorescence
  imaging modalities and provides tools for image adjustment,
  cropping, rotation, and multi-channel TIFF handling.
  Version 1.0.3 adds 8-bit TIFF support with mandatory quality
  warnings on import and flagging in integrity reports and at
  export, Inkscape-style crop handles (corner and edge midpoint
  resize with generous hit zones), project archiving (soft-hide
  and restore without deleting data), and editable levels
  controls where Black and White values can be typed directly
  as well as adjusted via slider.
keywords:
